    <nav class="nav-section">
        <div class="nav-label">Management</div>

        @* Manage Team is visible to every member: View Team, Jobs Roster, and
           View Invites are read-only/self-service (no manage permission needed
           server-side). Only "Add Members" requires CanManageMembers. *@
